1
00:00:01,126 --> 00:00:02,836
-Another monster's coming.
-[all gasp]

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,796
-Just great.
-[EMILY] Where is it?

3
00:00:05,464 --> 00:00:07,174
-There, in the sky!
-[gasps]

4
00:00:10,761 --> 00:00:12,429
Bad news, you guys.

5
00:00:12,512 --> 00:00:14,056
Extremely bad news.

6
00:00:15,349 --> 00:00:16,975
-[screeching]
-That's a griffon!

7
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:20,979
[♪ opening theme song playing]

8
00:01:51,945 --> 00:01:53,405
[MAKOTO] It's massive!

9
00:01:54,114 --> 00:01:55,532
Calm Mind.

10
00:01:58,577 --> 00:01:59,703
[griffon growls]

11
00:01:59,786 --> 00:02:01,163
[all gasp]

12
00:02:01,747 --> 00:02:02,664
[griffon screeching]

13
00:02:02,748 --> 00:02:04,416
-Incoming!
-Run!

14
00:02:11,006 --> 00:02:13,091
[LUCY]
Oh, no, it's eating our quarry!

15
00:02:13,175 --> 00:02:15,135
[JEAN]
So, it wanted the bison meat?

16
00:02:15,218 --> 00:02:18,138
Unfortunately, we've gotta
call this one a wash.

17
00:02:18,221 --> 00:02:19,639
Yeah, shoot.

18
00:02:22,225 --> 00:02:23,143
[griffon screeches]

19
00:02:23,226 --> 00:02:24,394
[gasping]

20
00:02:24,478 --> 00:02:25,687
[griffon growling]

21
00:02:25,771 --> 00:02:27,856
-[gasps]
-Come to think of it,

22
00:02:27,939 --> 00:02:30,025
I heard powerful monsters
like this guy prefer

23
00:02:30,108 --> 00:02:32,402
-to hunt prey with tons of mana.
-Huh?

24
00:02:34,529 --> 00:02:36,656
-Oh, crap.
-Does it think we're its prey?

25
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:38,408
[griffon screeching]

26
00:02:38,492 --> 00:02:39,993
[screaming]

27
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:41,453
Watch out!

28
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:45,916
[Makoto grunts]

29
00:02:46,708 --> 00:02:47,918
[griffon screeching]

30
00:02:48,001 --> 00:02:49,378
Here it comes!

31
00:02:50,629 --> 00:02:51,880
[grunting]

32
00:02:55,717 --> 00:02:57,302
We're trapped!

33
00:02:57,386 --> 00:02:58,720
[MAKOTO] This is bad.

34
00:02:59,304 --> 00:03:01,890
Hey, Lucy,
got any spells you could try?

35
00:03:01,973 --> 00:03:03,058
Uh, maybe so.

36
00:03:03,141 --> 00:03:04,434
[griffon roars]

37
00:03:05,227 --> 00:03:06,228
[both gasp]

38
00:03:06,311 --> 00:03:08,897
[Lucy whimpers]

39
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:11,900
[Makoto grunting]

40
00:03:14,236 --> 00:03:15,445
Makoto!

41
00:03:15,529 --> 00:03:16,822
[Makoto panting]

42
00:03:16,905 --> 00:03:18,907
-[footsteps running]
-[JEAN] You okay?

43
00:03:18,990 --> 00:03:21,576
Emily, hurry
and go heal up Lucy!

44
00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:22,786
Right!

45
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:24,704
[exhales]

46
00:03:24,788 --> 00:03:26,248
-[griffon screeching]
-Uh?

47
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:30,419
[MAKOTO] Damn, I'm out of mana.
But I've gotta do something!

48
00:03:33,213 --> 00:03:34,214
[gasps]

49
00:03:34,756 --> 00:03:36,800
Jean, think that
you could buy us some time?

50
00:03:36,883 --> 00:03:38,176
I need a sec to plan.

51
00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:40,595
Sure, but I don't know
for how long exactly.

52
00:03:40,679 --> 00:03:43,306
Thanks!
I'll try to work quickly.

53
00:03:43,390 --> 00:03:44,558
[JEAN] All right!

54
00:03:45,892 --> 00:03:47,561
[griffon roars]

55
00:03:47,936 --> 00:03:49,896
Hey, how about a Wind Blade!

56
00:03:50,647 --> 00:03:51,565
[whimpers]

57
00:03:54,276 --> 00:03:55,694
[grunting]

58
00:03:55,777 --> 00:03:58,280
[MAKOTO] Come on, think.
What do I do?

59
00:03:58,363 --> 00:04:01,616
[NOAH] Makoto, you need to make
your life the priority!

60
00:04:02,409 --> 00:04:05,287
[MAKOTO] Are you telling me
to leave my friends here to die?

61
00:04:05,954 --> 00:04:08,999
Sorry, Goddess, but that's not
something I can do.

62
00:04:09,082 --> 00:04:10,876
Then think of something quick!

63
00:04:10,959 --> 00:04:12,878
[MAKOTO] This thing
has to have a weakness.

64
00:04:12,961 --> 00:04:14,838
No monster
is completely invulnerable.

65
00:04:14,921 --> 00:04:16,840
[Lucy groans]

66
00:04:16,923 --> 00:04:18,884
Lucy, you all right?

67
00:04:19,301 --> 00:04:20,844
-[gasps]
-[griffon screeching]

68
00:04:21,553 --> 00:04:22,721
[grunting]

69
00:04:24,014 --> 00:04:25,015
[grunting]

70
00:04:25,098 --> 00:04:26,683
I'm reaching my limit here.

71
00:04:26,767 --> 00:04:29,603
[MAKOTO] Sorry,
just hang in there a bit longer.

72
00:04:30,437 --> 00:04:33,356
Okay, now, Lucy,
you able to gather your mana?

73
00:04:34,566 --> 00:04:36,318
If you're able
to handle that much,

74
00:04:36,401 --> 00:04:37,777
I can do all the rest.

75
00:04:38,904 --> 00:04:40,489
What are you planning to do?

76
00:04:40,989 --> 00:04:42,616
Just trust me, okay?

77
00:04:43,617 --> 00:04:45,619
Hmm. Always will.

78
00:04:45,702 --> 00:04:46,828
Good!

79
00:04:47,996 --> 00:04:48,872
[Lucy gasps]

80
00:04:48,955 --> 00:04:51,124
What's the big idea, Makoto?

81
00:04:53,752 --> 00:04:56,129
Hey, what kind of plan
is this, huh?

82
00:04:56,213 --> 00:04:57,380
Start chanting.

83
00:04:57,464 --> 00:04:58,965
[griffon screeching]

84
00:04:59,674 --> 00:05:00,634
[Jean grunts]

85
00:05:00,717 --> 00:05:03,011
-Jean, no!
-Hurry up.

86
00:05:03,094 --> 00:05:06,389
I know, I'm going.
You're just way too close.

87
00:05:06,473 --> 00:05:08,225
[MAKOTO]
This is probably a long shot,

88
00:05:08,892 --> 00:05:10,393
but it's all I've got.

89
00:05:12,270 --> 00:05:13,813
[MAKOTO] What's Synchro Magic?

90
00:05:13,897 --> 00:05:16,233
It is a special technique
that can allow a mage

91
00:05:16,316 --> 00:05:18,610
to gain influence
over another person's mana

92
00:05:18,693 --> 00:05:19,819
through physical touch.

93
00:05:19,903 --> 00:05:22,155
Wow, that's a real thing?

94
00:05:22,239 --> 00:05:24,157
Is every mage able to use it?

95
00:05:24,241 --> 00:05:27,369
Only those whose mastery
exceeds 50 can use it.

96
00:05:28,036 --> 00:05:29,287
♪

97
00:05:40,298 --> 00:05:42,175
[Lucy grunting softly]

98
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:44,594
[Makoto grunting]

99
00:05:45,095 --> 00:05:47,264
Is this really Lucy's mana?

100
00:05:47,347 --> 00:05:48,723
-[chimes]
-Huh?

101
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:52,227
[MAKOTO]
Obviously, I'm saying "yes."

102
00:05:53,645 --> 00:05:56,231
Yes, I'm sure.
I have no other option.

103
00:05:57,816 --> 00:05:59,985
♪

104
00:06:03,321 --> 00:06:05,657
[Makoto grunting]

105
00:06:09,661 --> 00:06:11,496
[Jean grunting]

106
00:06:12,581 --> 00:06:14,249
[MAKOTO] Get back, Jean!

107
00:06:16,001 --> 00:06:19,754
Fire Magic: Fire Storm!

108
00:06:22,799 --> 00:06:23,800
[griffon screeching]

109
00:06:23,884 --> 00:06:25,510
[gasps] No way!

110
00:06:25,594 --> 00:06:27,762
♪

111
00:06:30,098 --> 00:06:32,142
What? It dodged?

112
00:06:32,601 --> 00:06:33,935
[MAKOTO] Expand!

113
00:06:37,147 --> 00:06:40,025
[exclaims] You changed the shape
of the spell.

114
00:06:41,693 --> 00:06:43,278
-[griffon screeching]
-Get back here.

115
00:06:44,654 --> 00:06:46,031
[griffon screeching]

116
00:06:49,409 --> 00:06:52,537
Makoto, we can't keep this up!
Stop already!

117
00:06:54,914 --> 00:06:57,042
[Makoto grunting]

118
00:06:57,542 --> 00:06:58,793
Makoto, are you okay?

119
00:06:58,877 --> 00:07:00,921
You're setting yourself on fire!

120
00:07:01,588 --> 00:07:03,048
It's the end for you!

121
00:07:12,933 --> 00:07:15,060
[both gasp]

122
00:07:22,692 --> 00:07:24,819
[both gasp]

123
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:27,864
[JEAN] Did... we win?

124
00:07:27,947 --> 00:07:31,660
Incredible! I can't believe
we actually defeated a griffon.

125
00:07:32,243 --> 00:07:34,954
[sighs] Sure did.

126
00:07:35,038 --> 00:07:36,331
[LUCY] Hey, careful!

127
00:07:36,748 --> 00:07:38,583
Looks like
your coat's still on fire!

128
00:07:41,086 --> 00:07:42,712
You doing okay, Lucy?

129
00:07:42,796 --> 00:07:45,006
Yeah, I'm totally fine now.

130
00:07:45,632 --> 00:07:48,510
I'm glad. I was worried.

131
00:07:48,593 --> 00:07:49,594
-[gasps]
-[thuds]

132
00:07:49,969 --> 00:07:52,514
-[LUCY] Makoto!
-[JEAN] Quick, put out the fire!

133
00:07:54,516 --> 00:07:55,892
[NOAH] Hey.

134
00:07:56,184 --> 00:07:57,310
[gasps]

135
00:07:57,769 --> 00:08:00,105
[Noah grunting]

136
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:04,693
Hey, uh, are you mad at me
or something?

137
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:08,446
What was the first thing
I asked of you? Do you recall?

138
00:08:08,530 --> 00:08:09,447
[MAKOTO] Mm...

139
00:08:10,198 --> 00:08:12,117
You told me to grow stronger,
right?

140
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,576
That's not the part
I'm talking about.

141
00:08:13,660 --> 00:08:16,371
After that, I told you
"You're my only believer,

142
00:08:16,454 --> 00:08:18,707
so you can't die easily."
And what do you do?

143
00:08:18,790 --> 00:08:22,043
Huh? You're saying that I died?

144
00:08:22,127 --> 00:08:23,545
[Noah groans]

145
00:08:24,671 --> 00:08:25,672
Not yet.

146
00:08:25,755 --> 00:08:27,132
That priest from your team

147
00:08:27,215 --> 00:08:29,551
is working tirelessly
to heal you.

148
00:08:29,634 --> 00:08:32,178
Makoto! No, don't die on us!

149
00:08:32,262 --> 00:08:35,306
Hey, just calm down.
He's still breathing.

150
00:08:35,390 --> 00:08:37,684
[JEAN] Makoto, hang in there.

151
00:08:42,188 --> 00:08:44,232
Noah, I'm sorry.

152
00:08:44,858 --> 00:08:46,985
I pushed myself too hard today.

153
00:08:47,068 --> 00:08:49,696
You certainly did.
Ordinarily, you'd have died.

154
00:08:49,779 --> 00:08:50,780
Huh?

155
00:08:50,864 --> 00:08:52,991
-Take a look at this.
-Uh?

156
00:08:53,074 --> 00:08:55,201
[MAKOTO] Hang on a sec.
That's my Soul Book!

157
00:08:55,285 --> 00:08:57,662
Please don't take it
without asking me.

158
00:08:57,746 --> 00:08:59,289
Why should I have to ask?

159
00:08:59,372 --> 00:09:01,499
I was under the impression
you and I were close.

160
00:09:01,583 --> 00:09:02,959
But more importantly, look.

161
00:09:05,545 --> 00:09:07,338
The Blessing of Goddess Noah?

162
00:09:07,422 --> 00:09:10,049
Yes. Very well done, Makoto.

163
00:09:10,133 --> 00:09:13,303
Because of your daily prayers,
you gained my blessing,

164
00:09:13,386 --> 00:09:15,472
and that is what
saved your life.

165
00:09:16,139 --> 00:09:17,766
So that's how I survived.

166
00:09:17,849 --> 00:09:19,142
-Someone's happy.
-Uh?

167
00:09:19,225 --> 00:09:21,603
Though,
there is still more to unveil.

168
00:09:21,686 --> 00:09:23,855
-Look at this right here.
-Hmm.

169
00:09:24,856 --> 00:09:26,608
[MAKOTO] Elementalist?

170
00:09:26,691 --> 00:09:28,568
Yup, that's correct!

171
00:09:28,651 --> 00:09:31,404
We Titans are good friends
with the elementals, you know!

172
00:09:31,488 --> 00:09:33,615
This is a gift from yours truly.

173
00:09:33,698 --> 00:09:34,616
[gasps softly]

174
00:09:34,699 --> 00:09:35,867
[Noah giggles]

175
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:37,869
So, keep pushing yourself
to get stronger!

176
00:09:39,454 --> 00:09:41,915
Can a human really
wield this power?

177
00:09:41,998 --> 00:09:43,625
Of course they can.

178
00:09:44,459 --> 00:09:46,169
Are you unhappy with it?

179
00:09:46,252 --> 00:09:48,213
No, just the opposite.

180
00:09:48,755 --> 00:09:51,382
I'll be sure to put this power
to good use.

181
00:09:51,466 --> 00:09:54,803
-As you should.
-Before I forget, it's Lucy.

182
00:09:54,886 --> 00:09:56,763
Could I invite her
to become your believer?

183
00:09:56,846 --> 00:10:00,517
Uh... unfortunately,
I can't take her on.

184
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:04,020
I can only gain one believer
every 10 years, so...

185
00:10:04,104 --> 00:10:05,313
What?

186
00:10:05,772 --> 00:10:07,524
But don't worry about it.

187
00:10:07,607 --> 00:10:10,318
I'm fine so long as I have you.
[chuckles]

188
00:10:10,401 --> 00:10:12,195
See you around.

189
00:10:13,863 --> 00:10:16,324
[groans softly]

190
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:19,994
Ow, my everything.

191
00:10:20,078 --> 00:10:21,037
[Lucy gasps]

192
00:10:22,622 --> 00:10:25,124
Makoto, I'm so glad you're okay.

193
00:10:25,208 --> 00:10:26,876
I was so worried.

194
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:29,045
How long was I unconscious for
exactly?

195
00:10:29,129 --> 00:10:31,172
You were out
for nearly half a day.

196
00:10:31,256 --> 00:10:33,466
Everyone in the guild's been
beside themselves.

197
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:35,093
You really scared us.

198
00:10:35,176 --> 00:10:36,344
Oh, I'm sorry.

199
00:10:36,636 --> 00:10:38,346
[LUCY] Now they're all
down there throwing a party

200
00:10:38,429 --> 00:10:40,723
because a bronze rank
managed to defeat a griffon.

201
00:10:40,807 --> 00:10:41,975
[indistinct chatter]

202
00:10:42,058 --> 00:10:44,853
That tracks,
adventurers do love a party.

203
00:10:45,603 --> 00:10:47,355
-[LUCY] Um, Makoto?
-Hmm?

204
00:10:48,273 --> 00:10:50,650
If you're upset that
my magic hurt you...

205
00:10:51,067 --> 00:10:52,110
I understand.

206
00:10:52,193 --> 00:10:54,571
Nah, it was entirely on me.

207
00:10:54,654 --> 00:10:56,406
The teacher warned me
that I shouldn't go

208
00:10:56,489 --> 00:10:59,200
using Synchro with magic
I didn't have an affinity for,

209
00:10:59,284 --> 00:11:00,827
so I knew it was risky.

210
00:11:01,953 --> 00:11:03,496
No, it's my fault.

211
00:11:03,580 --> 00:11:04,831
Whoa, slow down!

212
00:11:04,914 --> 00:11:06,958
How was any of this stuff
your fault?

213
00:11:07,959 --> 00:11:12,005
Because within me
runs the foul blood of a demon.

214
00:11:12,088 --> 00:11:15,383
A demon? But I thought
that you were an elf.

215
00:11:15,466 --> 00:11:16,801
I am.

216
00:11:16,885 --> 00:11:20,388
My mother is an elf.
But my father...

217
00:11:21,598 --> 00:11:22,724
He's a demon

218
00:11:23,016 --> 00:11:25,476
whose entire body is covered
with scorching flames.

219
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:28,521
[gasps]
His whole body's on fire?

220
00:11:29,355 --> 00:11:31,691
Wait,
then how'd they make a baby?

221
00:11:31,774 --> 00:11:33,484
That's not exactly
the issue here.

222
00:11:33,568 --> 00:11:34,944
Yeah, sorry.

223
00:11:36,863 --> 00:11:38,990
Because I inherited his blood,

224
00:11:39,073 --> 00:11:41,367
I can use powerful Fire Magic

225
00:11:41,451 --> 00:11:43,953
and have the ability
to resist fire, too.

226
00:11:44,495 --> 00:11:47,790
But I still don't have
good control over my mana,

227
00:11:47,874 --> 00:11:50,460
so you got hurt. I'm sorry.

228
00:11:50,543 --> 00:11:52,045
This is all my fault.

229
00:11:53,171 --> 00:11:56,841
No, it's not. We'll just use
a different strategy next time.

230
00:11:56,925 --> 00:12:00,720
Even so, I've been so useless
on every outing.

231
00:12:00,803 --> 00:12:03,056
I haven't improved at all
during training,

232
00:12:03,139 --> 00:12:05,016
and all I do
is cause you trouble.

233
00:12:05,099 --> 00:12:07,310
I know you probably
only partnered with me

234
00:12:07,393 --> 00:12:08,895
'cause Lucas told you to, right?

235
00:12:10,271 --> 00:12:11,272
[MAKOTO] Lucy...

236
00:12:11,356 --> 00:12:12,398
[Lucy gasps]

237
00:12:12,815 --> 00:12:14,067
That isn't true.

238
00:12:14,984 --> 00:12:17,070
I need you to stay by my side,
Lucy.

239
00:12:17,153 --> 00:12:19,781
-Oh?
-I mean it.

240
00:12:21,282 --> 00:12:23,326
So let's get stronger together.

241
00:12:23,409 --> 00:12:28,039
[exclaims] Uh, you mean it?
Okie-dokie then!

242
00:12:28,122 --> 00:12:31,084
If that's the case,
I promise I'll do my best.

243
00:12:31,751 --> 00:12:33,836
[MAKOTO] Huh? Oh, shoot.

244
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:37,590
Why'd I have to go and say it
in such an embarrassing way?

245
00:12:39,008 --> 00:12:41,928
[birds chirping]

246
00:12:42,595 --> 00:12:43,972
[door opens]

247
00:12:44,055 --> 00:12:45,974
[LUCY] Knock-knock,
how're you feeling?

248
00:12:46,057 --> 00:12:47,934
[MAKOTO] A lot better, actually.

249
00:12:48,017 --> 00:12:50,353
Glad to hear it.
I brought these for you.

250
00:12:50,436 --> 00:12:52,438
Huh? What are you reading there?

251
00:12:52,522 --> 00:12:55,066
Well, I can't walk around yet,

252
00:12:55,149 --> 00:12:57,235
so I started studying
elemental magic.

253
00:12:57,318 --> 00:13:00,947
Huh? But a mage
can't use elemental magic

254
00:13:01,030 --> 00:13:03,032
unless they speak Elementali.

255
00:13:03,116 --> 00:13:04,742
Mm. Yeah, I know that,

256
00:13:04,826 --> 00:13:07,036
which is why I wanted
to learn some of the basics,

257
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,579
but it's not
in any books I've found.

258
00:13:08,663 --> 00:13:11,749
Oh. I doubt you'd find
Elementali textbooks,

259
00:13:11,833 --> 00:13:13,334
at least not here in Macallan.

260
00:13:13,418 --> 00:13:14,836
Seriously?

261
00:13:14,919 --> 00:13:17,088
I mean, human Elementalists

262
00:13:17,171 --> 00:13:19,007
aren't exactly a thing,
you know.

263
00:13:19,090 --> 00:13:20,174
[Makoto sighs]

264
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:22,760
[MAKOTO] The goddess told me
I could use it,

265
00:13:22,844 --> 00:13:25,138
but how do I go about
learning it?

266
00:13:25,221 --> 00:13:26,848
Hi, you feeling better?

267
00:13:26,931 --> 00:13:28,016
Hey, Mary.

268
00:13:28,099 --> 00:13:29,934
Would you look at that
handsome face.

269
00:13:30,018 --> 00:13:31,394
You healed up beautifully.

270
00:13:31,477 --> 00:13:32,979
-[Lucy grunting]
-[MAKOTO] Get off me, Mary.

271
00:13:33,062 --> 00:13:34,856
I'm still recovering.

272
00:13:35,982 --> 00:13:38,693
You sure you want to speak
to your hero so harshly?

273
00:13:38,776 --> 00:13:41,320
A little birdy told me
you learned a new skill,

274
00:13:41,404 --> 00:13:43,114
-so I brought you this.
-[exclaims]

275
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:45,658
[MAKOTO] My first Elementali?

276
00:13:45,742 --> 00:13:46,951
That's right.

277
00:13:47,243 --> 00:13:49,370
I had it brought over
from the guild in Spring Rogue.

278
00:13:49,454 --> 00:13:51,122
It was no easy feat.

279
00:13:51,205 --> 00:13:52,707
This is huge! Thank you!

280
00:13:52,790 --> 00:13:56,627
Of course. Though it is still
guild property, so be careful.

281
00:13:56,711 --> 00:13:58,588
Best of luck, Makoto.

282
00:13:58,671 --> 00:14:00,381
-Thanks.
-[chuckles]

283
00:14:02,216 --> 00:14:04,677
-[Lucy grunting]
-[Makoto giggling]

284
00:14:04,761 --> 00:14:06,220
Congratulations.

285
00:14:06,304 --> 00:14:08,056
Can't believe she found this.

286
00:14:08,139 --> 00:14:10,224
Now I can start training
my elemental magic.

287
00:14:10,308 --> 00:14:11,351
Great!

288
00:14:12,602 --> 00:14:13,895
♪

289
00:14:29,744 --> 00:14:31,454
[EMILY] Just like that,
you're all better.

290
00:14:31,537 --> 00:14:34,123
Thanks to your healing.
You're the best.

291
00:14:34,207 --> 00:14:35,750
[Emily chuckles]

292
00:14:36,793 --> 00:14:38,628
[footsteps]

293
00:14:39,420 --> 00:14:41,756
[LUCY] Oh, Goddess, grant me
not the fires of destruction...

294
00:14:41,839 --> 00:14:44,133
That's a lot of kobolds.
[grunts]

295
00:14:44,217 --> 00:14:46,260
[growling]

296
00:14:46,719 --> 00:14:47,887
[MAKOTO] Dodge!

297
00:14:48,471 --> 00:14:50,723
Water Magic. Ice Needle Attack!

298
00:14:52,433 --> 00:14:53,392
[groaning]

299
00:14:53,476 --> 00:14:54,352
You ready, Lucy?

300
00:14:54,435 --> 00:14:55,728
Yeah.

301
00:14:56,395 --> 00:14:59,607
Fire... Ball!

302
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:00,858
[yells]

303
00:15:00,942 --> 00:15:02,693
No, not again!

304
00:15:04,028 --> 00:15:05,905
-[Lucy gasps]
-[kobolds groaning]

305
00:15:07,615 --> 00:15:08,699
[MAKOTO] Uh?

306
00:15:08,783 --> 00:15:10,743
[Lucy groaning]

307
00:15:10,827 --> 00:15:13,162
Uh, all according to plan!

308
00:15:14,122 --> 00:15:16,749
Hey, Makoto,
are you not done hunting?

309
00:15:16,833 --> 00:15:19,710
I wanna do some more
since it's been a while.

310
00:15:19,794 --> 00:15:21,587
Plus, there's something
I wanna try.

311
00:15:21,671 --> 00:15:22,672
[LUCY] Hmm.

312
00:15:22,755 --> 00:15:24,507
I noticed during the fight,

313
00:15:24,590 --> 00:15:27,677
you've gotten a lot faster
with your chanting. It's great.

314
00:15:29,220 --> 00:15:30,304
[LUCY] Oh.

315
00:15:32,306 --> 00:15:34,809
-Um, Makoto?
-Huh?

316
00:15:40,064 --> 00:15:41,691
Swear not to look.

317
00:15:41,774 --> 00:15:43,568
[MAKOTO] I promise I won't.

318
00:15:43,651 --> 00:15:45,194
I'm just keeping watch.

319
00:15:47,947 --> 00:15:50,950
[LUCY] Makoto really is
a mysterious kind of guy.

320
00:15:51,033 --> 00:15:54,078
He isn't like the people
I've partied with before.

321
00:15:54,162 --> 00:15:56,205
He's never once made fun of me.

322
00:15:57,081 --> 00:15:59,625
He's not
an overly friendly person,

323
00:15:59,709 --> 00:16:03,004
and it's not like his skills are
anything to write home about.

324
00:16:04,005 --> 00:16:06,716
Even so,
Makoto keeps adventuring,

325
00:16:06,799 --> 00:16:08,176
and even though he's so aloof,

326
00:16:08,259 --> 00:16:10,720
the guild's paying attention
to him.

327
00:16:11,554 --> 00:16:13,514
-Makoto?
-Yeah?

328
00:16:13,598 --> 00:16:14,807
I was wondering,

329
00:16:14,891 --> 00:16:16,851
why do you choose
to stay at the guild hall?

330
00:16:16,934 --> 00:16:19,312
Wouldn't the inn be
more comfortable?

331
00:16:19,395 --> 00:16:21,856
[MAKOTO] Well, it's 'cause
I can't afford the inn.

332
00:16:21,939 --> 00:16:23,107
Uh...

333
00:16:23,691 --> 00:16:25,651
I see. Well then,

334
00:16:25,735 --> 00:16:27,862
I have a proposal
that could help you out.

335
00:16:28,946 --> 00:16:30,198
As you know,

336
00:16:30,281 --> 00:16:33,117
I'm currently staying
at a pretty nice inn.

337
00:16:34,452 --> 00:16:37,997
So if you're okay with it,
you could always join me--

338
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:39,290
-[MAKOTO] There's an ogre.
-[gasps]

339
00:16:39,957 --> 00:16:42,210
What do we do? Makoto?

340
00:16:44,003 --> 00:16:44,921
[gasps]

341
00:16:45,546 --> 00:16:46,505
You okay?

342
00:16:49,842 --> 00:16:52,178
[ogre growling]

343
00:16:52,261 --> 00:16:53,304
[Lucy gasps]

344
00:16:54,096 --> 00:16:55,556
-[MAKOTO] Water Magic...
-Uh?

345
00:16:55,640 --> 00:16:57,225
Now Freeze!

346
00:16:59,435 --> 00:17:01,771
[LUCY] Huh?
You already took it out?

347
00:17:01,854 --> 00:17:02,855
Yeah.

348
00:17:03,856 --> 00:17:05,608
[gasps]

349
00:17:05,691 --> 00:17:09,111
Lucy, you... um, you're naked.

350
00:17:09,195 --> 00:17:10,321
What?

351
00:17:12,114 --> 00:17:13,157
[Lucy gasps]

352
00:17:13,241 --> 00:17:14,283
[Lucy screaming]

353
00:17:14,367 --> 00:17:16,202
[Makoto gasps]
Cool it. Cool it, Lucy.

354
00:17:16,285 --> 00:17:17,620
[Lucy continues screaming]

355
00:17:18,746 --> 00:17:21,624
And once again, you nearly
burned my body to a crisp.

356
00:17:22,416 --> 00:17:24,627
[LUCY] So, you saw everything?

357
00:17:25,253 --> 00:17:27,380
[MAKOTO]
No, I didn't see a thing.

358
00:17:27,463 --> 00:17:29,131
[LUCY] You liar.
You totally saw me.

359
00:17:29,215 --> 00:17:31,050
I swear that I didn't.

360
00:17:32,093 --> 00:17:33,052
[Lucy grunts]

361
00:17:34,053 --> 00:17:36,347
I was right about you,
you're a weirdo.

362
00:17:36,430 --> 00:17:38,975
-Uh, say what?
-You heard me!

363
00:17:39,058 --> 00:17:40,142
[Makoto groans]

364
00:17:46,732 --> 00:17:49,193
[Makoto inhales, exhales]

365
00:17:49,277 --> 00:17:51,153
Roh-fu Bow-oh
Ta-oh Sah-toe-day...

366
00:17:54,031 --> 00:17:56,575
-Nothing, huh?
-Still not making any headway?

367
00:17:56,659 --> 00:17:58,744
Uh, I could be doing
something wrong.

368
00:17:58,828 --> 00:18:01,706
Elementali isn't exactly
an easy language.

369
00:18:01,789 --> 00:18:02,748
[gasps]

370
00:18:04,917 --> 00:18:06,419
[groans]

371
00:18:07,378 --> 00:18:10,756
Man, today, I've been
covered in mud, soaked,

372
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:12,675
and even seen naked.

373
00:18:12,758 --> 00:18:13,926
What was that?

374
00:18:14,010 --> 00:18:15,303
[LUCY] Oh, nothing!

375
00:18:15,386 --> 00:18:17,221
[MAKOTO] Sorry.
Let me dry you off.

376
00:18:18,347 --> 00:18:20,182
Water Magic: Evaporate.

377
00:18:20,266 --> 00:18:21,309
[Lucy yelps]

378
00:18:23,477 --> 00:18:24,437
Huh?

379
00:18:25,396 --> 00:18:27,023
Whoa, I'm all dry.

380
00:18:27,106 --> 00:18:29,275
That's incredible.
Nice work, Makoto.

381
00:18:30,276 --> 00:18:32,236
That huge deluge of water...

382
00:18:33,029 --> 00:18:35,114
Was that due to elemental mana?

383
00:18:35,197 --> 00:18:38,159
Huh? You mean you didn't just
pull the water from the lake?

384
00:18:38,242 --> 00:18:39,744
-[MAKOTO] Hmm.
-Uh?

385
00:18:41,787 --> 00:18:44,415
Roh-fu Bow-oh
Ta-oh Sah-toe-day...

386
00:18:47,293 --> 00:18:48,669
Hey...

387
00:18:48,753 --> 00:18:50,338
It's really starting
to feel like

388
00:18:50,421 --> 00:18:52,673
you're drenching my clothes
on purpose, you know?

389
00:18:52,757 --> 00:18:54,175
[indistinct chatter]

390
00:18:55,843 --> 00:18:56,927
[LUCY] Makoto...

391
00:18:57,011 --> 00:18:58,095
I wanted to go back

392
00:18:58,179 --> 00:18:59,722
to what we were
talking about earlier.

393
00:18:59,805 --> 00:19:02,016
I know. I'm sorry
for so many mishaps

394
00:19:02,099 --> 00:19:03,184
with the Water Magic.

395
00:19:03,809 --> 00:19:05,644
Jeez, that's not what I meant.

396
00:19:05,728 --> 00:19:07,104
It's about the inn.

397
00:19:07,188 --> 00:19:08,773
If you're okay with it,

398
00:19:08,856 --> 00:19:10,900
then you and I
could be roommates.

399
00:19:10,983 --> 00:19:12,526
[MAKOTO] Oh, Fujiyan!

400
00:19:14,070 --> 00:19:15,613
[chuckles]

401
00:19:15,696 --> 00:19:18,491
-Sorry, what'd you say?
-Nothing, you big jerk.

402
00:19:18,574 --> 00:19:19,492
[MAKOTO] Hmm?

403
00:19:20,284 --> 00:19:21,869
[ALL] Cheers!

404
00:19:22,536 --> 00:19:23,996
♪

405
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:25,498
[LUCY] It's nice to meet you.

406
00:19:25,581 --> 00:19:27,792
My name's Lucy, a mage.

407
00:19:27,875 --> 00:19:30,669
And my name is Fujiwara,
I'm a merchant.

408
00:19:30,753 --> 00:19:33,923
But you can call me Fujiyan
like Tackie here does.

409
00:19:34,006 --> 00:19:37,343
Oh, I'm Nina. I'm an employee
of the Fujiwara Company,

410
00:19:37,426 --> 00:19:38,719
but I do some adventuring, too.

411
00:19:38,803 --> 00:19:40,429
Don't let her looks fool you.

412
00:19:40,513 --> 00:19:42,348
Nina's a silver-ranked
adventurer.

413
00:19:42,431 --> 00:19:43,974
Wow, that's awesome.

414
00:19:44,058 --> 00:19:46,685
My specialty
is the Fire Magic King skill!

415
00:19:46,769 --> 00:19:47,853
[FUJIYAN] Whoa!

416
00:19:48,229 --> 00:19:50,356
[MAKOTO] Slow down, girl.
Don't be a show off.

417
00:19:50,439 --> 00:19:53,776
Actually, Makoto and I
recently became bronze-ranked.

418
00:19:53,859 --> 00:19:55,611
Dang, that's impressive.

419
00:19:55,695 --> 00:19:58,030
You've really outdone yourself
this time, Tackie.

420
00:19:58,114 --> 00:20:00,449
Not just anyone can get
a gorgeous elf mage

421
00:20:00,533 --> 00:20:01,951
to tag along with them,
you know.

422
00:20:02,034 --> 00:20:03,035
-[Lucy exclaims]
-[chuckles]

423
00:20:03,369 --> 00:20:05,538
The word around the guild
is you've been busy.

424
00:20:05,621 --> 00:20:07,790
You took out both,
a bison and a griffon.

425
00:20:07,873 --> 00:20:10,751
We did,
but I made a huge mistake.

426
00:20:10,835 --> 00:20:12,670
Makoto was burnt by my magic.

427
00:20:12,753 --> 00:20:13,796
[MAKOTO]
Hey, it's not your fault.

428
00:20:13,879 --> 00:20:15,214
How did that happen?

429
00:20:16,048 --> 00:20:18,175
Well, we were
in a pretty tight spot,

430
00:20:18,259 --> 00:20:21,137
but luckily, with Lucy's power,
we managed to figure it out.

431
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:23,347
I got banged up,
but thanks to Jean and Emily...

432
00:20:23,431 --> 00:20:25,141
-Jean? Emily?
-...I'm good now.

433
00:20:25,224 --> 00:20:27,184
It's true that you got better,

434
00:20:27,268 --> 00:20:29,728
but I still seriously injured
a party mate.

435
00:20:29,812 --> 00:20:32,189
Don't you remember what
Lucas and Mary said, though?

436
00:20:32,273 --> 00:20:33,482
-Lucas?
-[MAKOTO] A single member...

437
00:20:33,566 --> 00:20:34,692
-Mary?
-...isn't responsible

438
00:20:34,775 --> 00:20:37,069
for a party's successes
or mistakes.

439
00:20:37,486 --> 00:20:38,404
[Fujiyan grunts]

440
00:20:39,071 --> 00:20:40,781
What? Are you okay, boss?

441
00:20:40,865 --> 00:20:42,324
Fujiyan?

442
00:20:42,408 --> 00:20:44,827
[sighs] My dear Tackie!

443
00:20:44,910 --> 00:20:46,036
What is it?

444
00:20:46,120 --> 00:20:47,663
[FUJIYAN]
Unless my ears deceive me,

445
00:20:47,746 --> 00:20:49,915
it sounds to me like
you've gone and found yourself

446
00:20:49,999 --> 00:20:51,584
-a new group of friends.
-Huh?

447
00:20:51,667 --> 00:20:53,794
I have been waiting so long
for you,

448
00:20:53,878 --> 00:20:56,172
praying that you would come
and recruit me to your party,

449
00:20:56,255 --> 00:20:58,924
and here you are
flaunting your new friends

450
00:20:59,008 --> 00:21:00,301
without even thinking of me.

451
00:21:00,384 --> 00:21:02,094
Oh, come on, man.

452
00:21:02,178 --> 00:21:03,637
[NINA] Please,
you have to understand.

453
00:21:03,721 --> 00:21:05,848
My boss has really been
looking forward

454
00:21:05,931 --> 00:21:07,558
to joining your party
and helping you out

455
00:21:07,641 --> 00:21:08,601
on your adventures.

456
00:21:09,185 --> 00:21:10,311
Oh, snap. My bad.

457
00:21:10,394 --> 00:21:12,062
[Fujiyan cries]

458
00:21:12,813 --> 00:21:16,442
It's just so lonely, you know?
I wanna help.

459
00:21:17,776 --> 00:21:19,570
I'm really sorry, Fujiyan.

460
00:21:20,237 --> 00:21:21,447
A lot's been going on,

461
00:21:21,530 --> 00:21:23,741
and I never had a chance
to ask you.

462
00:21:25,826 --> 00:21:26,869
[FUJIYAN] Huh?

463
00:21:27,411 --> 00:21:29,747
Fujiyan,
let me do this properly.

464
00:21:30,164 --> 00:21:31,874
Do you wanna party up with me?

465
00:21:31,957 --> 00:21:34,293
[Fujiyan exclaiming]

466
00:21:34,376 --> 00:21:36,837
Yes. I've been waiting so long

467
00:21:36,921 --> 00:21:38,923
to hear you say
those words, Tackie!

468
00:21:40,257 --> 00:21:42,676
I'd love to join, too,
if you'll have me.

469
00:21:42,760 --> 00:21:45,137
Of course, Nina.
You cool with that?

470
00:21:45,221 --> 00:21:46,430
Yeah.

471
00:21:47,014 --> 00:21:48,682
How about we all head
to a dungeon?

472
00:21:48,766 --> 00:21:50,267
Well, you all up for it?

473
00:21:50,351 --> 00:21:51,685
[BOTH] What?

474
00:21:51,769 --> 00:21:54,271
Your ranks are high enough.
It'll be fine.

475
00:21:54,939 --> 00:21:57,358
Well, wanna give this a go?

476
00:21:57,441 --> 00:21:58,567
Heck yeah.

477
00:21:58,651 --> 00:22:00,736
[MAKOTO] All right,
tomorrow we explore

478
00:22:00,820 --> 00:22:03,113
-our first dungeon!
-[ALL] Yeah!

479
00:22:05,032 --> 00:22:08,160
[♪ closing theme song playing]

